      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed by selecting Google Cloud Monitoring as the external provider. This should provide a good base for the project. Next steps will involve solidifying how I identify the provider in the Python file, and begin to focus on implementing the time-window query. I will also make sure the user can easily switch to a different provider in the future.\n\n\n**Defining the Script**\n\nI'm now focusing on setting up the `query_metric_window.py` script. The essential structure is taking shape. I'm importing the `google-cloud-monitoring` library and initializing the client. The core function will handle the query logic, accepting project ID, metric type, end time, and time window. Constructing the time interval and filter for the query is the next task.\n\n\n",
